{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a short-form roguelike\u00a0inspired by <strong>Seraphs Last Stand</strong> focused on fast runs, variety, and experimentation. Each run takes around <strong>30 minutes</strong> to complete, with <strong>5 distinct characters</strong> and <strong>22 unique abilities</strong> available from the start. There are no unlocks or progression systems \u2014 If your looking for a bite-sized roguelike you can jump into and finish in one sitting this is the one for you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/Combat_05.gif?t=1749571003\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is very accessible with Auto-Aim being the default allowing you to focus on navigating the chaotic environment. Controller and Keyboard both work great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various Characters</strong>: Choose from 5 characters each with unique base abilities to change the pace of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/CharacterSelect_02.gif?t=1749571003\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/Upgrades_02.gif?t=1749571003\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2014no grinding required\u2014creating a hop-in, hop-out experience for players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558240?t=1749571003","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558240?t=1749571003","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/9722fbbf23b58716b4a3d853f9e504dee05ec80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749571003","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/9722fbbf23b58716b4a3d853f9e504dee05ec80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749571003","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3709410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a short-form roguelike\u00a0inspired by <strong>Seraphs Last Stand</strong> focused on fast runs, variety, and experimentation. Each run takes around <strong>30 minutes</strong> to complete, with <strong>5 distinct characters</strong> and <strong>22 unique abilities</strong> available from the start. There are no unlocks or progression systems \u2014 If your looking for a bite-sized roguelike you can jump into and finish in one sitting this is the one for you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/Combat_05.gif?t=1749571003\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is very accessible with Auto-Aim being the default allowing you to focus on navigating the chaotic environment. Controller and Keyboard both work great.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Various Characters</strong>: Choose from 5 characters each with unique base abilities to change the pace of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/CharacterSelect_02.gif?t=1749571003\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/extras/Upgrades_02.gif?t=1749571003\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2014no grinding required\u2014creating a hop-in, hop-out experience for players.</p>","developers":["Corey Shillingford"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558240/cfb809c89f7bbbdcde8dfcd2c87710f4ea95c152/header.jpg?t=1749571003","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109500,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109500/movie480.mp4?t=1749361062","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109500/movie_max.mp4?t=1749361062"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109500/1892178e606cb76777f1f962c899d108beb03d9c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749361062","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto